{"2783190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HolyZone", "steam_appid": 2783190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HolyZone: Strategy and Survival in a Deserted World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HolyZone is a strategy and survival game set in a world turned into a desert by nuclear wars. Gather scarce resources, manage your team of workers, engineers, and soldiers, build makeshift structures, and engage in strategic battles against other towns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/7edde0a5f44b326ee0e5aaa8d60f50da.poster.avif?t=1783172913\" width=620 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/7edde0a5f44b326ee0e5aaa8d60f50da.webm?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/7edde0a5f44b326ee0e5aaa8d60f50da.mp4?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD AND MANAGE YOUR CITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HolyZone takes place in a world turned into a desert after nuclear wars. In this harsh environment of perpetual daylight, you must build and manage your town to survive. Gather scarce resources, manage your team of workers, engineers, and soldiers, and engage in strategic battles against other towns. Every decision you make will determine the fate of your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/5602a1188e794aa41cdb84366404e255.poster.avif?t=1783172913\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/5602a1188e794aa41cdb84366404e255.webm?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/5602a1188e794aa41cdb84366404e255.mp4?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHAPE THE FUTURE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In critical moments, do not hesitate to make bold decisions that will shape the future of your people. Will you rule your town with an iron fist, or will you instill mercy and trust? Choose your leadership style, but remember: every decision is irreversible and will change the destiny of your town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/d852888149052221f494012f30bb9b80.poster.avif?t=1783172913\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/d852888149052221f494012f30bb9b80.webm?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/d852888149052221f494012f30bb9b80.mp4?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAKE STRATEGIC DECISIONS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve your town's problems and create new opportunities by making strategic decisions. Even seemingly small decisions can lead to significant outcomes. Your people trust you, but their loyalty is not endless. Leadership comes with great responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/4eb4309bfe0f1a86cd79083a4fb0648e.poster.avif?t=1783172913\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/4eb4309bfe0f1a86cd79083a4fb0648e.webm?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/4eb4309bfe0f1a86cd79083a4fb0648e.mp4?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TECHNOLOGICAL ADVANCEMENT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in technological advancements to survive. Strengthen your town's infrastructure. Overcome existing challenges and secure the future through continuous progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/bc879fe14d9e2b26ea5a713c81c7ed04.poster.avif?t=1783172913\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/bc879fe14d9e2b26ea5a713c81c7ed04.webm?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/bc879fe14d9e2b26ea5a713c81c7ed04.mp4?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE THE DESERT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your main focus is your town, exploring the outside world is crucial. Expeditions can provide valuable information and materials, and even increase your town's population. There might be other survivors out there, and their fate could be in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/373cabfffaf3b8536536da9be5a68b82.poster.avif?t=1783172913\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/373cabfffaf3b8536536da9be5a68b82.webm?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/373cabfffaf3b8536536da9be5a68b82.mp4?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HolyZone: Strategy and Survival in a Deserted World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HolyZone is a strategy and survival game set in a world turned into a desert by nuclear wars. Gather scarce resources, manage your team of workers, engineers, and soldiers, build makeshift structures, and engage in strategic battles against other towns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/7edde0a5f44b326ee0e5aaa8d60f50da.poster.avif?t=1783172913\" width=620 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/7edde0a5f44b326ee0e5aaa8d60f50da.webm?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783190/extras/7edde0a5f44b326ee0e5aaa8d60f50da.mp4?t=1783172913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD AND MANAGE YOUR CITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HolyZone takes place in a world turned into a desert after nuclear wars. In this harsh environment of perpetual daylight, you must build and manage your town to survive. Gather scarce resources, manage your team of workers, engineers, and soldiers, and engage in strategic battles against other towns. Every decision you make will determine the fate of your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_i